{'symbol': 'AJG', 'date': '2023-04-10 09:00:00', 'title': 'ARTHUR J. GALLAGHER & CO. ACQUIRES BOLEY-FEATHERSTON INSURANCE', 'text': 'ROLLING MEADOWS, ILL., APRIL 10, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ARTHUR J. GALLAGHER & CO. TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ACQUISITION OF WICHITA FALLS, TEXAS-BASED BOLEY-FEATHERSTON INSURANCE. TERMS OF THE TRANSACTION WERE NOT DISCLOSED.'}